  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Hubei Hydropower Development in Poor Areas Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project has three objectives: (a) facilitate economic growth in Hubei by expanding electric power generation capacity in an economically and environmentally sustainable manner; (b) enhance the efficiency of the electricity sector in Hubei by commercializing county generation companies; and (c) contribute to poverty alleviation efforts in poor communities in Hubei.</narrative>
  </description>
